{"schemaVersion":1,"slug":"kisir-turecky-bulgurovy-salat","title":"Kısır – turecký bulgurový salát","description":"Studený turecký salát z jemného bulguru, rajčat, petržele a melasy z granátového jablka.","demo":false,"yield":{"amount":6,"label":"porce"},"prepMinutes":15,"category":"Saláty","tags":["Turecká kuchyně","Veganské","Bulgur"],"ingredients":[{"items":[{"id":"bulgur","name":"jemný bulgur","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":2},"unit":"cup"},{"id":"voda","name":"vroucí voda","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":2},"unit":"cup"},{"id":"olej","name":"olivový olej","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":45},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"protlak","name":"rajčatový protlak","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":60},"unit":"ml","approximate":true},{"id":"paprikova-pasta","name":"turecká papriková pasta","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":3},"unit":"tbsp"},{"id":"chilli","name":"Urfa biber nebo chilli vločky","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"tsp"},{"id":"rimski-kmin","name":"mletý římský kmín","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.5},"unit":"tsp"},{"id":"sul","name":"sůl","quantity":{"kind":"text","text":"podle chuti"}},{"id":"granatova-melasa","name":"melasa z granátového jablka","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":2},"unit":"tbsp"},{"id":"citron","name":"citronová šťáva","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.5},"unit":"ks","note":"z citronu"},{"id":"cibulka","name":"jarní cibulky","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":6},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"rajcata","name":"pevná rajčata Roma","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":3},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"petrzel","name":"čerstvá petržel","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"cup","note":"nasekaná"}]}],"steps":["Bulgur zalijte vroucí vodou tak, aby byl právě ponořený. Přiklopte a nechte 15 minut změknout.","Na oleji krátce prohřejte rajčatový protlak, paprikovou pastu, chilli, kmín a sůl. Vmíchejte do bulguru spolu s melasou a citronovou šťávou.","Bulgur vychlaďte, poté vmíchejte cibulku, rajčata a petržel. Před podáváním dochu